    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Most Natural Thing</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;[A series of chapters - scenes from Catra and Adora's journey to become parents.]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's nearly a year after the war, and Catra's starting to feel almost safe enough to start having the beginnings of some serious thoughts about the future - her future with Adora. But first, she's got some issues to hash out with where she comes from herself.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
